      "html": "<div id=\"step-q94820\" class=\"step questionWidget\" stepid=\"q94820\" questionid=\"94820\" format=\"MC\" answer=\"\" current=\"false\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 2</div><div class=\"questionWidget-calculatorIcon\"><svg enable-background=\"new 0 0 128 128\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"m102.11.5h-76.22c-5.75 0-10.43 4.68-10.43 10.43v106.14c0 5.75 4.68 10.43 10.43 10.43h76.22c5.75 0 10.43-4.68 10.43-10.43v-106.14c0-5.75-4.68-10.43-10.43-10.43zm6.43 116.57c0 3.55-2.88 6.43-6.43 6.43h-76.22c-3.55 0-6.43-2.88-6.43-6.43v-106.14c0-3.55 2.88-6.43 6.43-6.43h76.22c3.55 0 6.43 2.88 6.43 6.43z\"></path><path d=\"m93.96 12.83h-59.92c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v16.57c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h59.92c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-16.57c0-2.76-2.25-5-5-5zm1 21.57c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-59.92c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-16.57c0-.55.45-1 1-1h59.92c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m43.86 45.14h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m68.91 45.14h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m93.96 45.14h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.25-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m43.86 70.7h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m68.91 70.7h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m43.86 96.26h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m68.91 96.26h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v9.82c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-9.82c0-2.76-2.24-5-5-5zm1 14.82c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-9.82c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m93.96 70.7h-9.82c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5v35.38c0 2.76 2.24 5 5 5h9.82c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5v-35.38c0-2.76-2.25-5-5-5zm1 40.38c0 .55-.45 1-1 1h-9.82c-.55 0-1-.45-1-1v-35.38c0-.55.45-1 1-1h9.82c.55 0 1 .45 1 1z\"></path></g></svg></div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>In a music program at a college, an average of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"48\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of graduating students go on to pursue a career in music. Using the normal approximation to the binomial distribution, estimate the probability that in a graduating class of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"49\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> students, at least <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"50\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>110</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> students will go on to pursue a career in music. Give your final answer to <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"51\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> decimal places.</p>\n<p><em>Hint: The data below is taken from the table of values of the cumulative distribution function <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"52\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A6\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> for the standard normal distribution. </em></p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"5\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto;\">\n<tbody><tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\" width=\"25%\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"53\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"54\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>0.05</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"55\" style=\"font-size: 119.5%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"m