    "q-95719": {
      "dom_id": "step-q95719",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Which of the following probabilities could be approximated using the normal approximation of the binomial distribution?\n\nI. The probability that $5$ flights out of $50$ arrive late at an airport if the probability of arriving late is $0.09$ for each flight.\n\nII. The probability that a student correctly solves $3$ questions in a $5$-question math test if the student has a $46%$ probability of correctly answering each question.\n\nIII. The probability that a biased coin lands on heads more than $30$ times out of $80$ coin flips if the probability of a single flip landing on heads is $0.52.$",
      "worked_solution": "Given a binomial random variable $X∼B(n,p),$ if \n\n- $np>5,$ and\n\n- $n(1-p)>5,$\n\nwe can approximate $X$ as a normal random variable $Y$ with mean $\\mu =np$ and variance ${\\sigma }^{2}=np(1-p),$ that is, \n\n$$\nY∼N(np,np(1-p)).\n$$\n\nLet's now examine each situation.\n\n- In situation I, we have $n=50$ and $p=0.09.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}np & =50\\cdot 0.09 \\\\  & =4.5 \\\\  & ≯5.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we *cannot* use the normal approximation of the binomial distribution.\n\n- In situation II, we have $n=5$ and $p=0.46.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}np & =5\\cdot 0.46 \\\\  & =2.3 \\\\  & ≯5.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we *cannot* use the normal approximation of the binomial distribution.\n\n- In situation III, we have $n=80$ and $p=0.52.$ Therefore, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}np & =80\\cdot 0.52 \\\\  & =41.6 \\\\  & >5\\,✓ \\\\ n(1-p) & =80\\cdot (1-0.52) \\\\  & =38.4 \\\\  & >5.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can use the normal approximation of the binomial distribution.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"III only.\"",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95719-a",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I and II only",
              "html": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95719-b",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "III only",
              "html": "III only"
            },
            {
              "option": "c",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95719-c",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "I only",
              "html": "I only"
            },
            {
              "option": "d",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95719-d",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II only",
              "html": "II only"
            },
            {
              "option": "e",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95719-e",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "II and III only",
              "html": "II and III only"
            }
